     "text": "The hybrid quartet sold out the Ruby Room, and the bassist who had doubted him now drove the van."
    },
    {
     "index": 6,
     "text": "Mike wrote the quartet's first full set of fused tunes, and the band voted unanimously to press them onto vinyl."
    },
    {
     "index": 7,
     "text": "A torn tendon in his fretting hand ended Mike's playing, and he told the band the fusion had been a mistake."
    }
